title: $:/themes/tiddlywiki/elegant/sticky
tags: [[$:/tags/Stylesheet]]
code-body: yes

<!-- When sticky titles are enabled, vanilla gives the title an opaque
     background (tiddler-background). Override it to match THIS theme's leaf
     surface so the stuck header stays consistent. Higher specificity than
     vanilla's rule; only emitted while sticky is on.

     The bottom hairline is the one place this theme rules off UNDER a title
     rather than above it, and it is functional rather than decorative: a
     stuck title with no lower edge lets the body scroll invisibly beneath
     it. It appears only while sticky titles are switched on. -->
<$reveal state="$:/themes/tiddlywiki/vanilla/options/stickytitles" type="match" text="yes">
``
.tc-story-river .tc-tiddler-title {
	background: var(--e-paper);
	border-bottom: 1px solid var(--e-rule);
	padding-bottom: var(--e-space-2xs);
}
``
</$reveal>
